  "content": "\n\n<p>新增來自《Ben 10 終極異形》的兩種外星人：震蛙與毒氣俠</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>震蛙取得方式：</p>\n<p>尋找 Yetti Liar</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4e35fa61-b021-4874-819b-7b61d27445be.png\" width=\"314\" height=\"331\"></p>\n<p>從 Yetti Liar 身上獲得耶提毛皮</p>\n<p>讓雷電擊中耶提毛皮以解鎖外星毛皮</p>\n<p>使用它</p>\n<p><br>毒氣俠取得方式：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_00c4fc49-81e5-4664-9240-d51c6d80f02d.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"241\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
